(7375792, 1157744, 138630, '<td valign="top">Very cool drops shot - excellent focus and clarity and I love the look of the edge of space and the black hole or something.  Definitely cosmic for me.</td>', 'Very cool drops shot - excellent focus and clarity and I love the look of the edge of space and the black hole or something.  Definitely cosmic for me.', '2015-06-29 01:32:28.000000', NULL, 1),
