(7383362, 1157458, 46918, '<td valign="top">Hello from the critique club...<br/> <br/>I''ll start out on subject matter. Macro yes...puzzle not so much. At just a glance I can tell that this is a flower. Granted. I couldn''t identify what flower. I am sure that hurt your score some. As far as the shot itself, it''s not bad. I think this works well as a b&amp;w. I think that the crop should have been brought in slightly on the right. In the top right corner there is something that has kindof peeked into the frame that is a bit distracting. Otherwise good shot though</td>', 'Hello from the critique club... I''ll start out on subject matter. Macro yes...puzzle not so much. At just a glance I can tell that this is a flower. Granted. I couldn''t identify what flower. I am sure that hurt your score some. As far as the shot itself, it''s not bad. I think this works well as a b&w. I think that the crop should have been brought in slightly on the right. In the top right corner there is something that has kindof peeked into the frame that is a bit distracting. Otherwise good shot though', '2015-07-07 11:11:33.000000', NULL, 0),
(7383386, 1157247, 46918, '<td valign="top">Hello from the critique club...<br/> <br/>Interesting shot. Works perfectly for this challenge. I had no idea what it was until I read your description. I like the multiple colors illustrated here. Also you have nice leading lines that lead the eyes through the shot. Also I think the lighting turned out nice. Overall I think you did a good job with this capture. Happy shooting</td>', 'Hello from the critique club... Interesting shot. Works perfectly for this challenge. I had no idea what it was until I read your description. I like the multiple colors illustrated here. Also you have nice leading lines that lead the eyes through the shot. Also I think the lighting turned out nice. Overall I think you did a good job with this capture. Happy shooting', '2015-07-07 12:30:39.000000', NULL, 0),
(7383433, 1157666, 68504, '<td valign="top">one of my higher scores. I "puzzled" over it, it was familiar, like a collage but not. galvanized, what a concept.</td>', 'one of my higher scores. I "puzzled" over it, it was familiar, like a collage but not. galvanized, what a concept.', '2015-07-07 14:33:24.000000', NULL, 0),
